<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telebras, others started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telebras, others started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SBC Warburg analyst Zain Manekia said he initiated coverage of Telebras SA with a buy rating and 12-month price target of $100 per ADR.</p>
<p>-- &quot;(I)t is important to note that our investment opinion on Telebras includes a considerably higher level of risk than the original subsidiaries,&quot; Manekia said in a reserach note.</p>
<p>-- Telebras ADRs were up 1/4 at 78-5/8 on the NYSE.</p>
<p>-- Manekia also said he initiated coverage of Telemig with a buy rating;</p>
<p>-- Telerj with a buy rating;</p>
<p>-- Telesp with a hold rating;</p>
<p>-- Telepar with a hold rating.</p>
</text>
